\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><strong>President Donald J. Trump and his Administration have delivered the most dramatic decline in violent crime in American history. </strong>According to the FBI’s newly released <a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/fbi-releases-2025-reported-crimes-in-the-nation-statistics\">Uniform Crime Report for 2025</a>, America is safer than it has been in generations.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-48577\" style=\"width:650px\" srcset=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png 1920w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png?resize=600,338 600w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png?resize=768,432 768w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png?resize=1200,675 1200w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fbi-crime-drop-2025.png?resize=1536,864 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-largest-annual-drop-in-violent-crime-ever-recorded\"><strong>The Largest Annual Drop in Violent Crime Ever Recorded:</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Violent crime plunged 9.3% in 2025 — the largest annual decline on record.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Murder dropped 18.1% — tying the lowest rate in recorded history.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Robbery fell 18.5% — resulting in nearly 38,500 fewer robberies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rape declined 7.6% — resulting in more than 10,000 fewer victims.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aggravated assault fell 7.2% — resulting in over 62,700 fewer attacks.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Property crime dropped 12.4% — the second-largest decline in history, with nearly 750,000 fewer offenses.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>These numbers — in line with the </strong><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/crime-plummets-another-historic-low-under-president-trump/\"><strong>Council on Criminal Justice</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/icymi-violent-crime-keeps-falling-in-biggest-u-s-cities/\"><strong>Major Cities Chiefs Association</strong></a><strong>, and </strong><a href=\"https://www.pew.org/en/research-and-analysis/articles/2026/08/06/why-are-homicides-declining-across-the-united-states\"><strong>many</strong></a> <a href=\"https://jasher.substack.com/p/the-2026-us-murder-rate-will-be-by\"><strong>other</strong></a> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/interactive/2026/crime-rates-us-cities/\"><strong>sources</strong></a> <strong>— mark the decisive reversal of the crime crisis Democrats left behind.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Meanwhile, preliminary <a href=\"https://cde.ucr.cjis.gov/LATEST/resources/reports/UCR_Summary_of_Reported_Crimes_in_the_Nation_2025.pdf#page=4\">data</a> for the first half of 2026 shows the decline continuing and deepening, with violent crime down an additional 10.6%, murder down another 23%, rape down 18.6%, and robberies down 19.6% compared to the same period last year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-under-president-trump-and-director-kash-patel-the-fbi-has-unleashed-unprecedented-enforcement\"><strong>Under President Trump and Director Kash Patel, the FBI has unleashed unprecedented enforcement:</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Nearly 54,000 violent crime arrests (up 90%), including more than 31,000 violent criminals and gang members (up 30%).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nine of the FBI’s Ten Most Wanted fugitives <a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/us/fbi-captures-top-ten-most-wanted-fugitive-alleged-sinaloa-cartel-ties-patel-says\">captured</a> — more than twice as many as during the entire previous four-year Administration — alongside <a href=\"https://x.com/FBIDirectorKash/status/2087953045384495343\">four</a> of the FBI’s Most Wanted Fraudsters.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>More than 5,000 child predators and human traffickers arrested (up 13%).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>More than 11,000 child victims located and identified (up 21%).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Record disruptions across criminal, cyber, counterterrorism, counterintelligence, and international operations — taking down hundreds of cybercriminal enterprises, espionage rings, and terrorist networks.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<p><strong>President Trump backed law enforcement, empowered the FBI to hunt predators instead of political targets, and rejected the failed Democrat lunacy that left communities reeling. </strong>The results are clear: fewer murders, fewer victims, and safer streets.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-delivers-the-largest-drop-in-violent-crime-in-american-history/\">President Trump Delivers the Largest Drop in Violent Crime in American History</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
